<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan stock market closed for New Year holidays.</title>
<headline>Taiwan stock market closed for New Year holidays.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-01-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's stock market is closed on Wednesday due to New Year holidays. It will reopen on Saturday.</p>
<p>On Tuesday, the index ended 7.67 points or 0.11 percent up at 6,933.94. Turnover was a moderate T$44.8 billion.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
